  <h1>Overstuffed Chair - Polyurethane Foam</h1>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-4">
      <div class="img">
        <img src="/img/materials/Overstuffed_Chair_Polyurethane_Foam.JPG" />
              </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-8">
      <div class="details">
        <p>Polyurethane foam is a low density foam often used in upholstered furniture cushions.</p>
        <dl>
          <dt>Source:</dt>
          <dd>Samples cut from 0.75 m x 0.75 m x 0.2 m thick cushion taken from an overstuffed chair.</dd>
          <dt>Density:</dt>
          <dd>31.7 kg/m<sup>3</sup></dd>
          <dt>Scales:</dt>
          <dd>milligram, bench scale</dd>
          <dt>Categories:</dt>
          <dd>general polymer, upholstered furniture</dd>
                      <dt>Parent Material:</dt>
            <dd><a href="/materialdetail/overstuffed-chair-assembly">Overstuffed Chair Assembly</a></dd>
                            </dl>
        <p>
          <a href="https://github.com/ulfsri/fsri_materials_database/tree/main/01_Data/Overstuffed_Chair_Polyurethane_Foam" class="action-link primary">Download raw data</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
