                        <div class="accordion-item level-1">
          <h3 class="accordion-title" aria-label="Press enter to open" tabindex="0">Mass Loss Rate (MLR)</h3>
          <div class="accordion-body">
            <p>Initial-mass-normalized mass loss rate [1/s] was measured in the simultaneous thermal analyzer experiments at three heating rates: 3 K/min, 10 K/min, and 30 K/min and mass loss rate [g/s] in the cone calorimeter at three heat fluxes: 25 kW/m<sup>2</sup>, 50 kW/m<sup>2</sup>, and 75 kW/m<sup>2</sup>.</p>
