                        <div class="accordion-item level-1">
          <h3 class="accordion-title" aria-label="Press enter to open" tabindex="0">Carbon Monoxide (CO) Yield</h3>
          <div class="accordion-body">
            <p>Carbon monoxide yield was measured during cone calorimeter experiments conducted at heat fluxes of 25 kW/m<sup>2</sup>, 50 kW/m<sup>2</sup>, and 75 kW/m<sup>2</sup>.</p>
                                                                      <div class="responsive-table"><table class="dataframe">
  <thead>
    <tr style="text-align: right;">
      <th>Incident Heat Flux [kW/m²]</th>
      <th>Mean CO Yield [g/g]</th>
      <th>CO Yield Std. Dev. [g/g]</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>25</td>
      <td>0.014</td>
      <td>0.002</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>50</td>
      <td>0.011</td>
      <td>0.0</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>75</td>
      <td>0.013</td>
      <td>0.001</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table></div>
                                    </div>
        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item level-1">
          <h3 class="accordion-title" aria-label="Press enter to open" tabindex="0">Specific Heat Release Rate</h3>
          <div class="accordion-body">
            <p>Experiments for specific heat release rate [W/g], were conducted using a micro-scale combustion calorimeter at a heating rate of 30 K/min.</p>
